---
description: Never add Cursor attribution to git commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git — no Cursor attribution

Never include any of these in commits, pushes, or pull requests:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `Made with [Cursor](...)`

If a hook or tool adds them, strip with `git commit-tree` and `--force-with-lease`, or enable `.githooks/commit-msg`:

```bash
git config core.hooksPath .githooks
```
